  "description": {
    "en": "Chef Conor's Monthly Special pairs Toroline A5 Infrared 1.20 in the mains with Truffle X 1.30 in the crosses. A5 provides low-friction snapback, control, spin and a connected response, while Truffle X adds extreme elasticity, plush comfort, pocketing and pop. The result is a premium hybrid designed for players who want co-poly performance without the harshness of a full polyester stringbed. Toroline recommends 50-55 lbs as a starting tension reference with 5-10% prestretch for Truffle X, while keeping Truffle X knot tie-off force at or below 35 lbs.",

    "zh": "Chef Conor's Monthly Special 是由 Coach Conor Casey 策划的 Toroline Hybrid 配方，采用 A5 Infrared 1.20 作为主线，Truffle X 1.30 作为横线。A5 提供低摩擦 Snapback、控制、旋转以及清晰 Connected Feel；Truffle X 则增加极高弹性、Plush 舒适感、Pocketing 和 Pop。整体非常适合希望保留高性能 Co-Poly 控制与旋转，同时降低全聚酯线床硬度的球员。官方建议可从 50-55 lbs 开始，并对 Truffle X 使用 5-10% 预拉，同时结线时不要超过 35 lbs 的拉力。"
  },

